Package: q-sunshine-pve
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: q-sunshine contributors <q-sunshine@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/LizardByte/Sunshine
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Description: headless QEMU Display1 Sunshine backend for Proxmox VE 9
 This package contains the q-sunshine Sunshine build for the QEMU Display1
 D-Bus capture route, its QSF TLS companion utilities, a conservative
 per-guest systemd template, and the guest-side QSF sources.
 .
 It intentionally contains no X11, Wayland, PulseAudio, or ALSA host runtime
 dependency. It is designed for Proxmox VE 9 on Debian 13 (Trixie), with a
 QEMU instance exposing the Display1 D-Bus backend.
